5.78, "end": 129.56, "text": " The stone that the builders rejected has become the cornerstone.", "tokens": [50822, 440, 7581, 300, 264, 36281, 15749, 575, 1813, 264, 4538, 11243, 13, 51011], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2038722791169819, "compression_ratio": 1.69921875, "no_speech_prob": 0.001313913380727172}, {"id": 41, "seek": 11664, "start": 130.34, "end": 133.52, "text": " Everyone who falls on that stone will be broken to pieces,", "tokens": [51050, 5198, 567, 8804, 322, 300, 7581, 486, 312, 5463, 281, 3755, 11, 51209], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2038722791169819, "compression_ratio": 1.69921875, "no_speech_prob": 0.001313913380727172}, {"id": 42, "seek": 11664, "start": 134.12, "end": 137.88, "text": " and when it falls on anyone, it will crush him.", "tokens": [51239, 293, 562, 309, 8804, 322, 2878, 11, 309, 486, 10321, 796, 13, 51427], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2038722791169819, "compression_ratio": 1.69921875, "no_speech_prob": 0.001313913380727172}, {"id": 43, "seek": 11664, "start": 138.26, "end": 142.98, "text": " The scribes and the chief priests sought to lay hands on him at that very hour,", "tokens": [51446, 440, 39435, 279, 293, 264, 9588, 27192, 17532, 281, 2360, 2377, 322, 796, 412, 300, 588, 1773, 11, 51682], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2038722791169819, "compression_ratio": 1.69921875, "no_speech_prob": 0.001313913380727172}, {"id": 44, "seek": 11664, "start": 143.4, "end": 146.48, "text": " for they perceived that he had told this parable against them.", "tokens": [51703, 337, 436, 19049, 300, 415, 632, 1907, 341, 971, 712, 1970, 552, 13, 51857], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2038722791169819, "compression_ratio": 1.69921875, "no_speech_prob": 0.001313913380727172}, {"id": 45, "seek": 14664, "start": 146.89999999999998, "end": 148.23999999999998, "text": " But they feared the people.", "tokens": [50378, 583, 436, 30629, 264, 561, 13, 50445], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19098766177308327, "compression_ratio": 1.628691983122363, "no_speech_prob": 0.00286663300357759}, {"id": 46, "seek": 14664, "start": 149.1, "end": 152.6, "text": " So they watched him and sent spies who pretended to be sincere,", "tokens": [50488, 407, 436, 6337, 796, 293, 2279, 45858, 567, 45056, 281, 312, 16941, 11, 50663], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19098766177308327, "compression_ratio": 1.628691983122363, "no_speech_prob": 0.00286663300357759}, {"id": 47, "seek": 14664, "start": 152.89999999999998, "end": 154.98, "text": " that they might catch him in something he said,", "tokens": [50678, 300, 436, 1062, 3745, 796, 294, 746, 415, 848, 11, 50782], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19098766177308327, "compression_ratio": 1.628691983122363, "no_speech_prob": 0.00286663300357759}, {"id": 48, "seek": 14664, "start": 154.98, "end": 159.17999999999998, "text": " so as to deliver him up to the authority and jurisdiction of the governor.", "tokens": [50782, 370, 382, 281, 4239, 796, 493, 281, 264, 8281, 293, 27285, 295, 264, 12965, 13, 50992], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19098766177308327, "compression_ratio": 1.628691983122363, "no_speech_prob": 0.00286663300357759}, {"id": 49, "seek": 14664, "start": 159.95999999999998, "end": 160.82, "text": " So they asked him,", "tokens": [51031, 407, 436, 2351, 796, 11, 51074], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19098766177308327, "compression_ratio": 1.628691983122363, "no_speech_prob": 0.00286663300357759}, {"id": 50, "seek": 14664, "start": 161.38, "end": 168.67999999999998, "text": " Teacher, we know that you speak and teach rightly and show no partiality,", "tokens": [51102, 19745, 11, 321, 458, 300, 291, 1710, 293, 2924, 32879, 293, 855, 572, 14641, 507, 11, 51467], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19098766177308327, "compression_ratio": 1.628691983122363, "no_speech_prob": 0.00286663300357759}, {"id": 51, "seek": 14664, "start": 169.29999999999998, "end": 171.98, "text": " but truly teach the way of God.", "tokens": [51498, 457, 4908, 2924, 264, 636, 295, 1265, 13, 51632], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19098766177308327, "compression_ratio": 1.628691983122363, "no_speech_prob": 0.00286663300357759}, {"id": 52, "seek": 14664, "start": 173.2, "end": 176.51999999999998, "text": " Is it lawful for us to give tribute to Caesar?", "tokens": [51693, 1119, 309, 2101, 906, 337, 505, 281, 976, 24722, 281, 26678, 30, 51859], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19098766177308327, "compression_ratio": 1.628691983122363, "no_speech_prob": 0.00286663300357759}, {"id": 53, "seek": 17664, "start": 176.64, "end": 178.0, "text": " Or not?", "tokens": [50365, 1610, 406, 30, 50433], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.25006436035696383, "compression_ratio": 1.6872246696035242, "no_speech_prob": 0.00032757906592451036}, {"id": 54, "seek": 17664, "start": 178.67999999999998, "end": 181.6, "text": " But he perceived their craftiness and said to them,", "tokens": [50467, 583, 415, 19049, 641, 8448, 1324, 293, 848, 281, 552, 11, 50613], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.25006436035696383, "compression_ratio": 1.6872246696035242, "no_speech_prob": 0.00032757906592451036}, {"id": 55, "seek": 17664, "start": 182.45999999999998, "end": 183.6, "text": " Show me a denarius.", "tokens": [50656, 6895, 385, 257, 1441, 27440, 13, 50713], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.25006436035696383, "compression_ratio": 1.6872246696035242, "no_speech_prob": 0.00032757906592451036}, {"id": 56, "seek": 17664, "start": 184.57999999999998, "end": 187.11999999999998, "text": " Whose likeness and inscription does it have?", "tokens": [50762, 28463, 36946, 442, 293, 49882, 775, 309, 362, 30, 50889], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.25006436035696383, "compression_ratio": 1.6872246696035242, "no_speech_prob": 0.00032757906592451036}, {"id": 57, "seek": 17664, "start": 187.83999999999997, "end": 188.6, "text": " They said,", "tokens": [50925, 814, 848, 11, 50963], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.25006436035696383, "compression_ratio": 1.6872246696035242, "no_speech_prob": 0.00032757906592451036}, {"id": 58, "seek": 17664, "start": 189.32, "end": 190.51999999999998, "text": " Caesar's.", "tokens": [50999, 26678, 311, 13, 51059], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.25006436035696383, "compression_ratio": 1.6872246696035242, "no_speech_prob": 0.00032757906592451036}, {"id": 59, "seek": 17664, "start": 191.07999999999998, "end": 192.14, "text": " He said to them,", "tokens": [51087, 634, 848, 281, 552, 11, 51140], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.25006436035696383, "compression_ratio": 1.6872246696035242, "no_speech_prob": 0.00032757906592451036}, {"id": 60, "seek": 17664, "start": 192.94, "end": 195.73999999999998, "text": " Then render to Caesar the things that are Caesar's,", "tokens": [51180, 1396, 15529, 281, 26678, 264, 721, 300, 366, 26678, 311, 11, 51320], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.25006436035696383, "compression_ratio": 1.6872246696035242, "no_speech_prob": 0.00032757906592451036}, {"id": 61, "seek": 17664, "start": 196.14, "end": 198.61999999999998, "text": " and to God the things that are God's.", "tokens": [51340, 293, 281, 1265, 264, 721, 300, 366, 1265, 311, 13, 51464], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.25006436035696383, "compression_ratio": 1.6872246696035242, "no_speech_prob": 0.00032757906592451036}, {"id": 62, "seek": 17664, "start": 199.29999999999998, "end": 203.2, "text": " And they were not able in the presence of the people to catch him in what he said,", "tokens": [51498, 400, 436, 645, 406, 1075, 294, 264, 6814, 295, 264, 561, 281, 3745, 796, 294, 437, 415, 848, 11, 51693], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.25006436035696383, "compression_ratio": 1.6872246696035242, "no_speech_prob": 0.00032757906592451036}, {"id": 63, "seek": 17664, "start": 203.2, "end": 206.14, "text": " but marveling at his answer they became silent.", "tokens": [51693, 457, 23893, 278, 412, 702, 1867, 436, 3062, 12784, 13, 51840], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.25006436035696383, "compression_ratio": 1.6872246696035242, "no_speech_prob": 0.00032757906592451036}, {"id": 64, "seek": 20664, "start": 206.64, "end": 209.89999999999998, "text": " There came to him some Sadducees,", "tokens": [50365, 821, 1361, 281, 796, 512, 12269, 769, 384, 279, 11, 50528], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22335535451906538, "compression_ratio": 1.75, "no_speech_prob": 0.0017960491823032498}, {"id": 65, "seek": 20664, "start": 210.01999999999998, "end": 212.27999999999997, "text": " those who deny that there is a resurrection,", "tokens": [50534, 729, 567, 15744, 300, 456, 307, 257, 24150, 11, 50647], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22335535451906538, "compression_ratio": 1.75, "no_speech_prob": 0.0017960491823032498}, {"id": 66, "seek": 20664, "start": 212.27999999999997, "end": 214.48, "text": " and they asked him a question, saying,", "tokens": [50647, 293, 436, 2351, 796, 257, 1168, 11, 1566, 11, 50757], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22335535451906538, "compression_ratio": 1.75, "no_speech_prob": 0.0017960491823032498}, {"id": 67, "seek": 20664, "start": 214.92, "end": 220.67999999999998, "text": " Teacher, Moses wrote for us that if a man's brother dies,", "tokens": [50779, 19745, 11, 17580, 4114, 337, 505, 300, 498, 257, 587, 311, 3708, 2714, 11, 51067], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22335535451906538, "compression_ratio": 1.75, "no_speech_prob": 0.0017960491823032498}, {"id": 68, "seek": 20664, "start": 220.79999999999998, "end": 222.66, "text": " having a wife but no children,", "tokens": [51073, 1419, 257, 3836, 457, 572, 2227, 11, 51166], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22335535451906538, "compression_ratio": 1.75, "no_speech_prob": 0.0017960491823032498}, {"id": 69, "seek": 20664, "start": 223.1, "end": 227.23999999999998, "text": " the man must take the widow and raise up offspring for his brother.", "tokens": [51188, 264, 587, 1633, 747, 264, 37207, 293, 5300, 493, 36857, 337, 702, 3708, 13, 51395], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22335535451906538, "compression_ratio": 1.75, "no_speech_prob": 0.0017960491823032498}, {"id": 70, "seek": 20664, "start": 228.0, "end": 230.26, "text": " Now there were seven brothers.", "tokens": [51433, 823, 456, 645, 3407, 8452, 13, 51546], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22335535451906538, "compression_ratio": 1.75, "no_speech_prob": 0.0017960491823032498}, {"id": 71, "seek": 20664, "start": 230.79999999999998, "end": 234.2, "text": " The first took a wife and died without children,", "tokens": [51573, 440, 700, 1890, 257, 3836, 293, 4539, 1553, 2227, 11, 51743], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22335535451906538, "compression_ratio": 1.75, "no_speech_prob": 0.0017960491823032498}, {"id": 72, "seek": 20664, "start": 234.94, "end": 236.61999999999998, "text": " and the second and the third died without children.", "tokens": [51780, 293, 264, 1150, 293, 264, 2636, 4539, 1553, 2227, 13, 51864], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22335535451906538, "compression_ratio": 1.75, "no_speech_prob": 0.0017960491823032498}, {"id": 73, "seek": 23662, "start": 236.62, "end": 237.24, "text": " The third took her,", "tokens": [50365, 440, 2636, 1890, 720, 11, 50396], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21479769036321356, "compression_ratio": 1.6727272727272726, "no_speech_prob": 0.00043391360668465495}, {"id": 74, "seek": 23662, "start": 237.64000000000001, "end": 241.6, "text": " and likewise all seven left no children and died.", "tokens": [50416, 293, 32407, 439, 3407, 1411, 572, 2227, 293, 4539, 13, 50614], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21479769036321356, "compression_ratio": 1.6727272727272726, "no_speech_prob": 0.00043391360668465495}, {"id": 75, "seek": 23662, "start": 242.74, "end": 244.92000000000002, "text": " Afterward the woman also died.", "tokens": [50671, 2381, 1007, 264, 3059, 611, 4539, 13, 50780], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21479769036321356, "compression_ratio": 1.6727272727272726, "no_speech_prob": 0.00043391360668465495}, {"id": 76, "seek": 23662, "start": 245.82, "end": 247.88, "text": " In the resurrection, therefore,", "tokens": [50825, 682, 264, 24150, 11, 4412, 11, 50928], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21479769036321356, "compression_ratio": 1.6727272727272726, "no_speech_prob": 0.00043391360668465495}, {"id": 77, "seek": 23662, "start": 248.5, "end": 250.70000000000002, "text": " whose wife will the woman be?", "tokens": [50959, 6104, 3836, 486, 264, 3059, 312, 30, 51069], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21479769036321356, "compression_ratio": 1.6727272727272726, "no_speech_prob": 0.00043391360668465495}, {"id": 78, "seek": 23662, "start": 251.22, "end": 253.42000000000002, "text": " For the seven had her as wife.", "tokens": [51095, 1171, 264, 3407, 632, 720, 382, 3836, 13, 51205], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21479769036321356, "compression_ratio": 1.6727272727272726, "no_speech_prob": 0.00043391360668465495}, {"id": 79, "seek": 23662, "start": 254.22, "end": 255.48000000000002, "text": " And Jesus said to them,", "tokens": [51245, 400, 2705, 848, 281, 552, 11, 51308], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21479769036321356, "compression_ratio": 1.6727272727272726, "no_speech_prob": 0.00043391360668465495}, {"id": 80, "seek": 23662, "start": 256.18, "end": 259.86, "text": " The sons of this age marry and are given in marriage.", "tokens": [51343, 440, 13476, 295, 341, 3205, 9747, 293, 366, 2212, 294, 7194, 13, 51527], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21479769036321356, "compression_ratio": 1.6727272727272726, "no_speech_prob": 0.00043391360668465495}, {"id": 81, "seek": 23662, "start": 260.46, "end": 263.98, "text": " But those who are considered worthy to attain to that age", "tokens": [51557, 583, 729, 567, 366, 4888, 14829, 281, 23766, 281, 300, 3205, 51733], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21479769036321356, "compression_ratio": 1.6727272727272726, "no_speech_prob": 0.00043391360668465495}, {"id": 82, "seek": 23662, "start": 263.98, "end": 266.12, "text": " and to the resurrection from the dead,", "tokens": [51733, 293, 281, 264, 24150, 490, 264, 3116, 11, 51840], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21479769036321356, "compression_ratio": 1.6727272727272726, "no_speech_prob": 0.00043391360668465495}, {"id": 83, "seek": 26662, "start": 266.62, "end": 268.68, "text": " neither marry nor are given in marriage.", "tokens": [50365, 9662, 9747, 6051, 366, 2212, 294, 7194, 13, 50468], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21641257657843121, "compression_ratio": 1.7012987012987013, "no_speech_prob": 0.0006461484008468688}, {"id": 84, "seek": 26662, "start": 269.16, "end": 271.08, "text": " For they cannot die any more,", "tokens": [50492, 1171, 436, 2644, 978, 604, 544, 11, 50588], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21641257657843121, "compression_ratio": 1.7012987012987013, "no_speech_prob": 0.0006461484008468688}, {"id": 85, "seek": 26662, "start": 271.46, "end": 273.38, "text": " because they are equal to angels", "tokens": [50607, 570, 436, 366, 2681, 281, 18175, 50703], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21641257657843121, "compression_ratio": 1.7012987012987013, "no_speech_prob": 0.0006461484008468688}, {"id": 86, "seek": 26662, "start": 273.38, "end": 275.24, "text": " and are sons of God,", "tokens": [50703, 293, 366, 13476, 295, 1265, 11, 50796], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21641257657843121, "compression_ratio": 1.7012987012987013, "no_speech_prob": 0.0006461484008468688}, {"id": 87, "seek": 26662, "start": 275.68, "end": 277.3, "text": " being sons of the resurrection.", "tokens": [50818, 885, 13476, 295, 264, 24150, 13, 50899], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21641257657843121, "compression_ratio": 1.7012987012987013, "no_speech_prob": 0.0006461484008468688}, {"id": 88, "seek": 26662, "start": 278.4, "end": 280.32, "text": " But that the dead are raised,", "tokens": [50954, 583, 300, 264, 3116, 366, 6005, 11, 51050], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21641257657843121, "compression_ratio": 1.7012987012987013, "no_speech_prob": 0.0006461484008468688}, {"id": 89, "seek": 26662, "start": 280.8, "end": 281.98, "text": " even Moses showed,", "tokens": [51074, 754, 17580, 4712, 11, 51133], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21641257657843121, "compression_ratio": 1.7012987012987013, "no_speech_prob": 0.0006461484008468688}, {"id": 90, "seek": 26662, "start": 282.46, "end": 284.0, "text": " in the passage about the bush,", "tokens": [51157, 294, 264, 11497, 466, 264, 19910, 11, 51234], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21641257657843121, "compression_ratio": 1.7012987012987013, "no_speech_prob": 0.0006461484008468688}, {"id": 91, "seek": 26662, "start": 284.48, "end": 287.14, "text": " where he calls the Lord the God of Abraham", "tokens": [51258, 689, 415, 5498, 264, 3257, 264, 1265, 295, 17782, 51391], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21641257657843121, "compression_ratio": 1.7012987012987013, "no_speech_prob": 0.0006461484008468688}, {"id": 92, "seek": 26662, "start": 287.14, "end": 290.02, "text": " and the God of Isaac and the God of Jacob.", "tokens": [51391, 293, 264, 1265, 295, 22505, 293, 264, 1265, 295, 14117, 13, 51535], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21641257657843121, "compression_ratio": 1.7012987012987013, "no_speech_prob": 0.0006461484008468688}, {"id": 93, "seek": 26662, "start": 290.68, "end": 292.6, "text": " Now he is not God of the dead,", "tokens": [51568, 823, 415, 307, 406, 1265, 295, 264, 3116, 11, 51664], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21641257657843121, "compression_ratio": 1.7012987012987013, "no_speech_prob": 0.0006461484008468688}, {"id": 94, "seek": 26662, "start": 292.6, "end": 293.96, "text": " but of the living,", "tokens": [51664, 457, 295, 264, 2647, 11, 51732], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21641257657843121, "compression_ratio": 1.7012987012987013, "no_speech_prob": 0.0006461484008468688}, {"id": 95, "seek": 26662, "start": 294.52, "end": 296.2, "text": " for all live to him.", "tokens": [51760, 337, 439, 1621, 281, 796, 13, 51844], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21641257657843121, "compression_ratio": 1.7012987012987013, "no_speech_prob": 0.0006461484008468688}, {"id": 96, "seek": 29662, "start": 296.62, "end": 298.76, "text": " Then some of the scribes answered,", "tokens": [50365, 1396, 512, 295, 264, 39435, 279, 10103, 11, 50472], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2250077766284608, "compression_ratio": 1.5416666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 0.0008558164117857814}, {"id": 97, "seek": 29662, "start": 299.44, "end": 301.62, "text": " Teacher, you have spoken well.", "tokens": [50506, 19745, 11, 291, 362, 10759, 731, 13, 50615], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2250077766284608, "compression_ratio": 1.5416666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 0.0008558164117857814}, {"id": 98, "seek": 29662, "start": 302.34000000000003, "end": 305.12, "text": " For they no longer dared to ask him any question.", "tokens": [50651, 1171, 436, 572, 2854, 44564, 281, 1029, 796, 604, 1168, 13, 50790], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2250077766284608, "compression_ratio": 1.5416666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 0.0008558164117857814}, {"id": 99, "seek": 29662, "start": 305.74, "end": 306.78000000000003, "text": " But he said to them,", "tokens": [50821, 583, 415, 848, 281, 552, 11, 50873], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2250077766284608, "compression_ratio": 1.5416666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 0.0008558164117857814}, {"id": 100, "seek": 29662, "start": 307.4, "end": 311.1, "text": " How can they say that the Christ is David's son?", "tokens": [50904, 1012, 393, 436, 584, 300, 264, 2040, 307, 4389, 311, 1872, 30, 51089], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2250077766284608, "compression_ratio": 1.5416666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 0.0008558164117857814}, {"id": 101, "seek": 29662, "start": 311.66, "end": 314.38, "text": " For David himself says in the book of Psalms,", "tokens": [51117, 1171, 4389, 3647, 1619, 294, 264, 1446, 295, 26150, 2592, 11, 51253], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2250077766284608, "compression_ratio": 1.5416666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 0.0008558164117857814}, {"id": 102, "seek": 29662, "start": 315.06, "end": 316.88, "text": " The Lord said to my Lord,", "tokens": [51287, 440, 3257, 848, 281, 452, 3257, 11, 51378], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2250077766284608, "compression_ratio": 1.5416666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 0.0008558164117857814}, {"id": 103, "seek": 29662, "start": 317.22, "end": 318.52, "text": " Sit at my right hand,", "tokens": [51395, 14523, 412, 452, 558, 1011, 11, 51460], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2250077766284608, "compression_ratio": 1.5416666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 0.0008558164117857814}, {"id": 104, "seek": 29662, "start": 318.82, "end": 321.16, "text": " until I make your enemies your footstool.", "tokens": [51475, 1826, 286, 652, 428, 7805, 428, 2671, 372, 1092, 13, 51592], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2250077766284608, "compression_ratio": 1.5416666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 0.0008558164117857814}, {"id": 105, "seek": 29662, "start": 321.9, "end": 323.66, "text": " David thus calls him Lord.", "tokens": [51629, 4389, 8807, 5498, 796, 3257, 13, 51717], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2250077766284608, "compression_ratio": 1.5416666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 0.0008558164117857814}, {"id": 106, "seek": 29662, "start": 323.92, "end": 326.34000000000003, "text": " So how is he his son?", "tokens": [51730, 407, 577, 307, 415, 702, 1872, 30, 51851], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2250077766284608, "compression_ratio": 1.5416666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 0.0008558164117857814}, {"id": 107, "seek": 32662, "start": 327.08, "end": 329.06, "text": " And in the hearing of all the people,", "tokens": [50388, 400, 294, 264, 4763, 295, 439, 264, 561, 11, 50487], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22325842721121653, "compression_ratio": 1.6682692307692308, "no_speech_prob": 0.009265899658203125}, {"id": 108, "seek": 32662, "start": 329.16, "end": 330.32, "text": " he said to his disciples,", "tokens": [50492, 415, 848, 281, 702, 17209, 11, 50550], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22325842721121653, "compression_ratio": 1.6682692307692308, "no_speech_prob": 0.009265899658203125}, {"id": 109, "seek": 32662, "start": 331.2, "end": 332.76, "text": " Beware of the scribes,", "tokens": [50594, 879, 3039, 295, 264, 39435, 279, 11, 50672], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22325842721121653, "compression_ratio": 1.6682692307692308, "no_speech_prob": 0.009265899658203125}, {"id": 110, "seek": 32662, "start": 333.02, "end": 335.54, "text": " who like to walk around in long robes,", "tokens": [50685, 567, 411, 281, 1792, 926, 294, 938, 3870, 279, 11, 50811], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22325842721121653, "compression_ratio": 1.6682692307692308, "no_speech_prob": 0.009265899658203125}, {"id": 111, "seek": 32662, "start": 335.76, "end": 337.82, "text": " and love greetings in the marketplaces,", "tokens": [50822, 293, 959, 33667, 294, 264, 2142, 34840, 11, 50925], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22325842721121653, "compression_ratio": 1.6682692307692308, "no_speech_prob": 0.009265899658203125}, {"id": 112, "seek": 32662, "start": 338.18, "end": 340.24, "text": " and the best seats in the synagogues,", "tokens": [50943, 293, 264, 1151, 11069, 294, 264, 5451, 31599, 1247, 11, 51046], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22325842721121653, "compression_ratio": 1.6682692307692308, "no_speech_prob": 0.009265899658203125}, {"id": 113, "seek": 32662, "start": 340.38, "end": 342.38, "text": " and the places of honor at feasts,", "tokens": [51053, 293, 264, 3190, 295, 5968, 412, 579, 20765, 11, 51153], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22325842721121653, "compression_ratio": 1.6682692307692308, "no_speech_prob": 0.009265899658203125}, {"id": 114, "seek": 32662, "start": 342.68, "end": 344.68, "text": " who devour widows' houses,", "tokens": [51168, 567, 1905, 396, 5274, 1509, 6, 8078, 11, 51268], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22325842721121653, "compression_ratio": 1.6682692307692308, "no_speech_prob": 0.009265899658203125}, {"id": 115, "seek": 32662, "start": 345.06, "end": 347.58, "text": " and for a pretense make long prayers.", "tokens": [51287, 293, 337, 257, 659, 39595, 652, 938, 16860, 13, 51413], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22325842721121653, "compression_ratio": 1.6682692307692308, "no_speech_prob": 0.009265899658203125}, {"id": 116, "seek": 32662, "start": 347.58, "end": 350.58, "text": " They will receive the greater condemnation.", "tokens": [51413, 814, 486, 4774, 264, 5044, 30733, 399, 13, 51563], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22325842721121653, "compression_ratio": 1.6682692307692308, "no_speech_prob": 0.009265899658203125}], "language": "English"}